      en: ["Home to the David Dunlap Observatory, featuring Canada's largest telescope.", "Officially incorporated as a village in 1872.", "Formerly known as the 'Rose Capital of Canada' for its greenhouses.", "Located along the historic Yonge Street transportation corridor.", "Northern areas are situated on the protected Oak Ridges Moraine.", "Recognized as one of Canada's most affluent and diverse cities."],
