    image: "/poi-images/swift-current-cities-v2.webp",
    description: { de: "Eine Stadt im Südwesten von Saskatchewan, ein Zentrum für Landwirtschaft und Öl.", hu: "Saskatchewan tartomány délnyugati részén fekvő város, amely a Transz-Kanada autópálya mentén fontos közlekedési csomópont.", ro: "Un oraș în sud-vestul Saskatchewan, un centru pentru agricultură și petrol.", en: "Swift Current is a prairie city in southwestern Saskatchewan on the Trans-Canada Highway. It serves as a local supply centre and is known for rodeo events." },
    facts: {
      de: ["Landwirtschaft und Ölförderung", "Lyric Theatre (historisches Kino)", "Windkraftanlagen", "An der Trans-Canada-Autobahn"],
      hu: ["Népessége körülbelül 16 000 fő.", "1883-ban alapították a vasútvonal mentén.", "A Swift Current Creek nevű patakról kapta nevét."],
      ro: ["Agricultură și extracție de petrol", "Teatrul Lyric (cinematograf istoric)", "Turbine eoliene", "Pe autostrada Trans-Canada"],
      en: ["In southwestern Saskatchewan", "On the Trans-Canada Highway", "Known for Frontier Days Rodeo"]
    },
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      de: "Swift Current ist ein bedeutendes regionales Zentrum im Südwesten von Saskatchewan, gelegen am Swift Current Creek und dem Trans-Canada Highway. Die Entwicklung der Stadt begann im Jahr 1883, als die Canadian Pacific Railway hier ein Depot und eine Wasserstation für ihre Dampflokomotiven errichtete. Nachdem der Ort 1907 als Kleinstadt und 1914 als Stadt offiziell anerkannt wurde, wandelte er sich von einem einfachen Eisenbahnstützpunkt zu einem Knotenpunkt für die Landwirtschaft sowie die Öl- und Gasindustrie. Ein kulturelles Highlight ist das Lyric Theatre aus dem Jahr 1912, welches das älteste durchgehend betriebene Theater der Provinz darstellt. Die Stadt dient als Versorgungszentrum für über 50.000 Menschen in der umliegenden ländlichen Region. Die Landschaft ist geprägt von weiten Ebenen und fruchtbarem Boden, der vor allem für den großflächigen Weizenanbau und die Rinderzucht genutzt wird.",
      hu: "Swift Current délnyugat-Saskatchewan fontos regionális központja, amely a Swift Current-patak és a transzkandai autópálya mentén fekszik. A település története 1883-ban kezdődött, amikor a Kanadai Csendes-óceáni Vasút (CPR) vízvételi helyet és depót létesített itt gőzmozdonyai számára. A település 1907-ben kapott városi (town), majd 1914-ben nagyvárosi (city) rangot, fejlődését pedig a mezőgazdaság mellett a kőolaj- és földgázkitermelés fellendülése határozta meg. A város kulturális örökségének egyik legfontosabb eleme az 1912-ben épült Lyric Theatre, amely a tartomány legrégebbi, ma is működő színháza. A közösség minden évben megrendezi a Frontier Days fesztivált, amely a környék marhatenyésztő és földművelő hagyományai előtt tiszteleg. A város ma több mint 50 000 ember számára nyújt kereskedelmi és egészségügyi szolgáltatásokat a régióban.",
      ro: "Swift Current este un centru regional major din sud-vestul provinciei Saskatchewan, situat pe malul pârâului Swift Current și de-a lungul autostrăzii Trans-Canada. Istoria orașului a început în 1883, când Calea Ferată Canadian Pacific a stabilit aici un depou și o stație de alimentare cu apă pentru locomotivele cu abur. Încorporat oficial ca oraș în 1907 și primind statutul de „city” în 1914, Swift Current a evoluat dintr-un avanpost feroviar într-un hub vital pentru agricultură și industria de petrol și gaze. Un punct de reper cultural important este Teatrul Lyric, construit în 1912, care este cea mai veche instituție de acest tip aflată în funcțiune din provincie. Orașul deservește o populație rurală de peste 50.000 de locuitori, oferind facilități comerciale și medicale esențiale. Peisajul înconjurător este caracterizat de câmpii vaste, ideale pentru cultivarea grâului și creșterea bovinelor la scară largă.",
      en: "Swift Current is a major regional hub in southwestern Saskatchewan, situated along the Swift Current Creek and the Trans-Canada Highway. The settlement's origins date back to 1883, when the Canadian Pacific Railway established a depot and water station for its steam locomotives at this location. Officially incorporated as a town in 1907 and as a city in 1914, it evolved from a simple railway outpost into a center for agriculture and the oil and gas industry. A significant cultural landmark is the Lyric Theatre, built in 1912, which remains the oldest operating theatre in the province. The city serves as a service center for approximately 50,000 people in the surrounding rural region. Every year, the community celebrates its ranching and farming heritage through the Frontier Days regional fair and rodeo. The local economy is driven by large-scale wheat production and livestock operations supported by the fertile prairie soil.",
    }, image: "/poi-images/swift-current-cities-v2.webp",
    factsAdvanced: {
      de: ["Die Canadian Pacific Railway erreichte den Ort im Jahr 1883.", "Swift Current erhielt am 15. Januar 1914 den Status einer Stadt.", "Das Lyric Theatre wurde 1912 erbaut und ist das älteste der Provinz.", "Die Stadt liegt etwa 170 Kilometer westlich von Moose Jaw.", "Das erste Ölfeld in der Region wurde 1952 in Fosterton entdeckt.", "Der Swift Current Creek mündet nördlich der Stadt in den South Saskatchewan River."],
      hu: ["A Kanadai Csendes-óceáni Vasút 1883-ban érte el a települést.", "Swift Current 1914. január 15-én kapott nagyvárosi (city) rangot.", "A Lyric Theatre 1912-es megnyitása óta folyamatosan üzemel.", "A város a 4-es számú és az 1-es számú főút kereszteződésében fekszik.", "A régió első jelentős olajlelőhelyét 1952-ben találták meg Fostertonnál.", "A város tengerszint feletti magassága körülbelül 823 méter."],
      ro: ["Calea ferată Canadian Pacific a ajuns în această locație în 1883.", "Swift Current a fost declarat oficial oraș (city) la 15 ianuarie 1914.", "Teatrul Lyric, construit în 1912, este cea mai veche clădire de teatru activă.", "Orașul este situat la aproximativ 170 km vest de localitatea Moose Jaw.", "Descoperirea petrolului la Fosterton în 1952 a diversificat economia locală.", "Swift Current servește drept sediul administrativ al Diviziei Școlare Chinook."],
      en: ["The Canadian Pacific Railway arrived at the site in 1883.", "Swift Current was officially incorporated as a city on January 15, 1914.", "The Lyric Theatre, built in 1912, is the province's oldest operating theatre.", "The city is located approximately 170 kilometers west of Moose Jaw.", "The discovery of oil at Fosterton in 1952 sparked an economic boom.", "Swift Current is home to the Swift Current Broncos of the WHL."],
    },
